    "final_answer": "I have successfully completed the task. Let me provide a final summary of my findings.\n\n---\n\n## Task Completion Summary\n\n### 🚗 Parking Location in Salem\n- **Name:** Salem Parking\n- **Address:** 256 Essex St, Salem, MA 01970, USA\n- **Category:** Parking lot\n- **Rating:** 4.2 stars (12 reviews)\n\nThis is the most convenient parking area in Salem because it's centrally located in downtown Salem (very close to the Witch Museum, Town House, and other historic sites), and Marblehead is in the same state (Massachusetts), just a short drive north along the coast.\n\n### 🗺️ Route from Salem Parking to Marblehead, MA\n\n**Travel Options (with current traffic):**\n| Mode | Time |\n|------|------|\n| 🚗 Driving (via Lafayette St) | **15 min (4.2 miles)** — fastest |\n| 🚲 Cycling | 24 min |\n| 🚆 Public Transit | 44 min |\n| 🚶 Walking | 1 hr 24 min |\n\n**Primary Route (Driving) — 15 minutes, 4.2 miles, via Lafayette St**\n\n**Turn-by-Turn Directions (displayed on the map):**\n1. **Exit the parking lot,** heading toward Bridge St — 54 sec (0.1 mi)\n2. **Continue on the main route via Lafayette St** — 13 min (3.8 mi)\n3. **Arrive in Marblehead** — 1 min (0.2 mi)\n\n**Alternative Driving Routes Available:**\n- 16 min, 4.1 miles via Lafayette St and Pleasant St (usually a little congested)\n- 15 min, 4.6 miles via Lafayette St and W Shore Dr\n\n### 📌 Additional Map Features Found\n- The route is visualized on the map with the blue path between the two points\n- There's a \"Live Traffic\" toggle option (实时路况) to view current traffic conditions\n- Side panel offers options to send the route to your phone, share the route, or print it\n- The directions panel can be expanded to show full turn-by-turn details\n\nThe map directions and route are now fully displayed and ready for use.",
